{
 "nodes": [
  {
   "id": "hdr",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "## Evaluation harness\nThe rule graph, its stages, rule enforcement, Mastra, self-improvement.\nparent: [docs hub](../README.md)\nscope: design only",
   "x": 0,
   "y": -260,
   "width": 640,
   "height": 200
  },
  {
   "id": "stamp",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "## stamp\nno harness code yet, so nothing to verify against\nMastra `@mastra/core` 1.79.0, harness2 `1cfe254e`, 2026-10-24\ndescribes: design/*.md, plans/2026-10-24-harness-plan.md\n_unverified_",
   "x": 700,
   "y": -260,
   "width": 640,
   "height": 200
  },
  {
   "id": "gA",
   "type": "group",
   "label": "Which node makes what?",
   "x": 0,
   "y": 0,
   "width": 1000,
   "height": 640,
   "color": "6"
  },
  {
   "id": "dom",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "## `domain` node\nCreates the criteria of the domain.\nreads: past criteria tables, records\nwrites: criteria, candidate attributes\nstage: `define_criteria`",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 60,
   "width": 280,
   "height": 200,
   "color": "5"
  },
  {
   "id": "inn",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "## `inner` node\nJudges relevance and meaning of each criterion.\nreads: parent node criteria\nwrites: node criteria, additions, attributes\nstage: `create_node`",
   "x": 360,
   "y": 60,
   "width": 280,
   "height": 200,
   "color": "5"
  },
  {
   "id": "leaf",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "## `leaf` node\nGets the pack and the layout.\nreads: node criteria, attributes\nwrites: evaluation pack, layout\nstages: `create_pack`, `create_layout`",
   "x": 680,
   "y": 60,
   "width": 280,
   "height": 200,
   "color": "5"
  },
  {
   "id": "rec",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "## record system\nKeeps the research behind each output.\nwrites: research records, append-only\nlinks: each criterion, attribute, rule",
   "x": 360,
   "y": 380,
   "width": 280,
   "height": 200,
   "color": "5"
  },
  {
   "id": "gB",
   "type": "group",
   "label": "What runs in one stage?",
   "x": 1100,
   "y": 0,
   "width": 1400,
   "height": 640,
   "color": "6"
  },
  {
   "id": "ctx",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "## `context`\nReads the graph for one node.\nreads: path to root, rules in scope\nreads: records, sibling nodes",
   "x": 1140,
   "y": 60,
   "width": 240,
   "height": 180,
   "color": "4"
  },
  {
   "id": "res",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "## `research`\nResearches under the rules.\ntools: `web_search`, `web_fetch`\ntools: `get_node_context`, `search_records`",
   "x": 1420,
   "y": 60,
   "width": 240,
   "height": 180,
   "color": "4"
  },
  {
   "id": "dra",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "## `draft`\nFills the output that shape rules define.\nwrites: one output",
   "x": 1700,
   "y": 60,
   "width": 240,
   "height": 180,
   "color": "4"
  },
  {
   "id": "jud",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "## `judge`\nRuns each rule in scope.\ndecides: pass, fail, cannot verify\nwrites: `VerdictRow`",
   "x": 1980,
   "y": 60,
   "width": 240,
   "height": 180,
   "color": "4"
  },
  {
   "id": "rep",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "## `repair`\nSends the exact errors back.\nbudget: 3 rounds",
   "x": 1980,
   "y": 360,
   "width": 240,
   "height": 180,
   "color": "4"
  },
  {
   "id": "per",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "## `person`\nDecides on a spent budget.\nAlso decides on a strict cannot verify.",
   "x": 1700,
   "y": 360,
   "width": 240,
   "height": 180,
   "color": "4"
  },
  {
   "id": "asm",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "## `assimilate`\nAccepts the output into the graph.\nwrites: output, records, verdicts",
   "x": 1420,
   "y": 360,
   "width": 240,
   "height": 180,
   "color": "4"
  },
  {
   "id": "gC",
   "type": "group",
   "label": "How is a rule enforced?",
   "x": 0,
   "y": 740,
   "width": 1000,
   "height": 640,
   "color": "6"
  },
  {
   "id": "rr",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "## `RuleRecord`\nOne instruction with its check.\nholds: id, version, statement, reason\nholds: kind, scope, binding, examples",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 800,
   "width": 280,
   "height": 200,
   "color": "3"
  },
  {
   "id": "cmp",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "## rule compiler\nTurns rules in scope into checks.\nwrites: schema parts, instructions\nwrites: code checks, judge questions",
   "x": 360,
   "y": 800,
   "width": 280,
   "height": 200,
   "color": "3"
  },
  {
   "id": "bind",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "## binding\nSets what a fail does.\nvalues: `strict`, `soft`, `watch`",
   "x": 680,
   "y": 800,
   "width": 280,
   "height": 200,
   "color": "5"
  },
  {
   "id": "chg",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "## rule change\nTries a new version as watch.\nreads: golden examples, recent outputs\ndecides: Rohan promotes out of watch",
   "x": 360,
   "y": 1100,
   "width": 280,
   "height": 200,
   "color": "3"
  },
  {
   "id": "never",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "## never\nCode gives no final grade or match.\nCannot verify is never pass or fail.",
   "x": 680,
   "y": 1100,
   "width": 280,
   "height": 200,
   "color": "1"
  },
  {
   "id": "gD",
   "type": "group",
   "label": "Where does it run on Mastra?",
   "x": 1100,
   "y": 740,
   "width": 1400,
   "height": 640,
   "color": "6"
  },
  {
   "id": "mwf",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "## workflows\nOne `createWorkflow` for each stage.\nrepair: `.dountil` with a budget\nperson: `suspend`, `resume`",
   "x": 1140,
   "y": 800,
   "width": 300,
   "height": 200,
   "color": "4"
  },
  {
   "id": "mag",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "## agents\nResearcher, drafter, editors.\nreads: `RequestContext` with the node\nwrites: `structuredOutput`",
   "x": 1480,
   "y": 800,
   "width": 300,
   "height": 200,
   "color": "4"
  },
  {
   "id": "msc",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "## scorers\nOne scorer for each check rule.\ncode checks: function steps\njudges: `analyze` prompt step",
   "x": 1820,
   "y": 800,
   "width": 300,
   "height": 200,
   "color": "4"
  },
  {
   "id": "mds",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "## datasets, experiments\nGolden examples and rule trials.\nCI gate: `runEvals`",
   "x": 1140,
   "y": 1100,
   "width": 300,
   "height": 200,
   "color": "3"
  },
  {
   "id": "mdb",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "## our graph tables\nNodes, rules, records, verdicts.\nDrizzle ORM on the Mastra client",
   "x": 1480,
   "y": 1100,
   "width": 300,
   "height": 200,
   "color": "5"
  },
  {
   "id": "mrules",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "## `rules/` in git\nStage rules, one YAML file each.\nreviewed by PR",
   "x": 1820,
   "y": 1100,
   "width": 300,
   "height": 200,
   "color": "3"
  },
  {
   "id": "gE",
   "type": "group",
   "label": "How does the harness improve its own rules?",
   "x": 0,
   "y": 1480,
   "width": 2500,
   "height": 560,
   "color": "6"
  },
  {
   "id": "iref",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "## reference runs\nk runs of the published rules.\nwrites: traces, outputs, visible verdicts",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 1540,
   "width": 280,
   "height": 190,
   "color": "2"
  },
  {
   "id": "ied",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "## editors\nPropose edits to the stage rules.\nkinds: process, domain\nreads: evidence pack, lessons",
   "x": 360,
   "y": 1540,
   "width": 280,
   "height": 190,
   "color": "2"
  },
  {
   "id": "ival",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "## `proposal_validator`\nChecks the structure of each edit.\nretry: one, then the base",
   "x": 680,
   "y": 1540,
   "width": 280,
   "height": 190,
   "color": "2"
  },
  {
   "id": "ipr",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "## probes\nOne stage run for each candidate.\nwrites: traces, outputs",
   "x": 1000,
   "y": 1540,
   "width": 280,
   "height": 190,
   "color": "2"
  },
  {
   "id": "ico",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "## `composer`\nMerges, adopts one, or keeps the base.\nreads: probes against reference runs",
   "x": 1320,
   "y": 1540,
   "width": 280,
   "height": 190,
   "color": "2"
  },
  {
   "id": "isel",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "## `blind_selector`\nPicks one anonymous final output.",
   "x": 1640,
   "y": 1540,
   "width": 280,
   "height": 190,
   "color": "2"
  },
  {
   "id": "iref2",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "## `reflector`\nWrites edit verdicts and one lesson.\nwrites: `lesson_library`",
   "x": 1960,
   "y": 1540,
   "width": 280,
   "height": 190,
   "color": "2"
  },
  {
   "id": "igate",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "## `promotion_gate`\nHeld-out suite on node and descendants.\ndecides: Rohan says yes",
   "x": 1640,
   "y": 1800,
   "width": 280,
   "height": 190,
   "color": "1"
  },
  {
   "id": "ifw",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "## `measurement_firewall`\nKeeps the held-out suite away.\nrefuses: held-out paths and verdicts",
   "x": 360,
   "y": 1800,
   "width": 280,
   "height": 190,
   "color": "1"
  },
  {
   "id": "f1",
   "type": "file",
   "file": "design/rule-graph.md",
   "x": 0,
   "y": 2120,
   "width": 400,
   "height": 120
  },
